    "sections": {
        "description": "The Medcare Center Theme is designed for healthcare clinics, medical centers, doctors, diagnostic labs, and wellness services seeking a clean and organized online presence. It includes responsive layouts, service sections, appointment forms, doctor profiles, testimonials, and contact information blocks to help visitors access important healthcare details easily. The theme supports customization options for colors, typography, banners, and page layouts without requiring coding knowledge. Built with SEO-friendly and mobile-compatible design standards, it helps improve accessibility across devices. Integration with popular plugins, social media links, and blog sections allows medical organizations to share updates and healthcare information efficiently. Its structured layout and user-friendly navigation make it suitable for hospitals, pharmacies, pediatric clinics, dental care centers, and general healthcare practices."
    },
